{{!
  cargo-about's template for the Rust crates part of THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES:
  each distinct license text once, and the crates under it by name and
  version. Triple braces throughout, since this is plain text and not
  HTML. scripts/notices.sh runs it.
~}}
The crates compiled into greycard-ui and greycard (the command line),
for every platform a release is built for, grouped by the license
greycard takes each under. Where a crate offers a choice, the license
named is the one taken. Each text below is the crate's own file for
that license, with the copyright lines it carries; where a crate ships
none, the license's standard text is given, with its placeholders
unfilled, and a few crates' own files are that unfilled text. The
notices some crates keep in other files follow the texts. greycard's
own crates that the editor links are listed under GPL-3.0-or-later
for completeness, and greycard-cli, the command line, is under the
same license; LICENSE beside this file is theirs.

